-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §37 ותק בהוראה: the seniority by which a
-- teacher moves up the new table is teaching seniority as the takanon
-- defines it, now and as amended — without the internship and without
-- compulsory IDF service, but with IDF or national service in teaching —
-- and, for an existing teacher, every year recognised for his salary on the
-- eve of his move to the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `37 ותק בהוראה`

@desc A teacher's years, as far as §37 asks; what the takanon counts as teaching seniority is the takanon's (an input).
DECLARE `years of a teacher` HAS
    `teaching years the takanon recognises` IS A NUMBER @desc teaching seniority by the takanon, as it is from time to time
    `internship years in them`              IS A NUMBER
    `compulsory IDF service in them`        IS A NUMBER
    `IDF or national service in teaching`   IS A NUMBER @desc recognised by the rules the takanon sets
    `an existing teacher`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `years recognised for salary on the eve of the move` IS A NUMBER

-- (א): the takanon's teaching seniority, less the internship and less
-- compulsory IDF service, plus IDF or national service in teaching.
@ref akn:art_37__para_a
GIVEN y IS A `years of a teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recognised seniority under 37(א)` y IS
    y's `teaching years the takanon recognises`
        MINUS y's `internship years in them`
        MINUS y's `compulsory IDF service in them`
        PLUS  y's `IDF or national service in teaching`

-- (ב): for an existing teacher, every year recognised for salary on the
-- eve of the move is in it ("ייכללו": in, at the least).
@ref akn:art_37__para_b
GIVEN y IS A `years of a teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recognised seniority` y IS
    IF y's `an existing teacher`
    THEN max (`recognised seniority under 37(א)` y) (y's `years recognised for salary on the eve of the move`)
    ELSE `recognised seniority under 37(א)` y

`a new teacher's years` MEANS
    `years of a teacher` WITH
        `teaching years the takanon recognises` IS 6
        `internship years in them`              IS 1
        `compulsory IDF service in them`        IS 0
        `IDF or national service in teaching`   IS 2
        `an existing teacher`                   IS FALSE
        `years recognised for salary on the eve of the move` IS 0
#ASSERT `recognised seniority` `a new teacher's years` EQUALS 7
